+# TLS Certificate Verification Policy
+
+TLS certificate verification is required in all builds of this project, including development builds; an earlier workaround that disabled certificate verification for development builds was proposed and then explicitly rejected in favor of requiring verification everywhere, so no development-only exception currently exists.
